">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>885.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mausoleum\" title=\"Mausoleum\"><img alt=\"Stage Mausoleum icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mausoleum icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Stage_Mausoleum_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172400\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gehenna\" title=\"Gehenna\"><img alt=\"Stage Gehenna icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Gehenna icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Gehenna_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/8f/Stage_Gehenna_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172420\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Cultists</b> are an enemy added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">The Binding of Isaac: Repentance</a></i>.\n</p><p>At the start of the room, they create a homing, indestructible &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Ball#Purple_Ball\" title=\"Dark Ball\"><img alt=\"Purple Ball\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Purple Ball.png\" data-image-key=\"Purple_Ball.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/9a/Purple_Ball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825141849\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Ball#Purple_Ball\" title=\"Dark Ball\">Purple Ball</a> (like &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rag_Mega\" title=\"Rag Mega\"><img alt=\"Boss Rag Mega ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Rag Mega ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Rag_Mega_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/ba/Boss_Rag_Mega_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822082111\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rag_Mega\" title=\"Rag Mega\">Rag Mega</a>'s) and proceed to follow it around on a brief delay. These purple balls fade into &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Ball\" title=\"Dark Ball\"><img alt=\"Dark Ball\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dark Ball.png\" data-image-key=\"Dark_Ball.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/63/Dark_Ball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822112755\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Ball\" title=\"Dark Ball\">Dark Balls</a> after 6 seconds, which can be destroyed as normal and have 10 HP. They cannot spawn another ball as long as the one they previously spawned is still intact.\n</p><p>If they detect an enemy has died in the current room, it will stop following the ball it summoned, move to where the enemy died, and resurrect it with full health before going back to following its ball.\n</p><p>They can revive up to 5 enemies at a time and cannot revive other Cultists. They can, however, revive most bosses and mini-bosses.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blood_Cultist\">Blood Cultist</span></h3><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><di